        "letter": "B",
        "text": "Create an IAM role named procurement-manager-role in all AWS accounts in the organization. Add the AdministratorAccess managed policy to the role. De ne a permissions boundary with the AWSPrivateMarketplaceAdminFullAccess managed policy and attach it to all the developer roles.",
        "text_zh": "在组织中的所有AWS帐户中建立名为采购经理角色的IAM角色。将 AdministratorAccess 托管策略新增至角色。使用 AWSPrivateMarketplaceAdminFullAccess 托管策略定义权限边界，并将其附加到所有开发人员角色。"
