        "letter": "A",
        "text": "Set up Amazon CodeGuru to pro le the Lambda functions and search for AWS API calls. Create an inventory of the required API calls and resources for each Lambda function. Create new IAM access policies for each Lambda function. Review the new policies to ensure that they meet the company's business requirements.",
        "text_zh": "设定 Amazon CodeGuru 来分析 Lambda 函数并搜索 AWS API 呼叫。为每个 Lambda 函数建立所需 API 呼叫和资源的清单。为每个 Lambda 函数建立新的 IAM 存取策略。审查新政策以确保它们满足公司的业务要求。"
