        "letter": "D",
        "text": "Create an Auto Scaling group. Configure an AWS Launch Wizard deployment that uses the new script as user data to configure the rewall appliances. Create a target group that uses the IP target type.",
        "text_zh": "建立一个Auto Scaling组。配置AWS启动精灵部署，该部署使用新脚本作为使用者资料来配置防火墙设备。建立使用 IP 目标类型的目标群组。"
